{"3618020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lullapops Sail Race", "steam_appid": 3618020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This game is intended for young children and their boating parents!<br> <br>- Very easy and casual playing or just watching -<br><br>Lullapops Sail Race</i></strong><i> is an exciting sailing and motorboat racing 3D physics game where you compete against autopilot controlled boats  in dynamic waters. Choose your skipper or  steer your boat  through red-green gates to victory! Experience realistic wind mechanics, master sailing strategies like tacking, or speed through the course in motorboat mode. Create custom race routes, adjust weather conditions, and challenge yourself to become the ultimate champion.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Learn the basics of sailing and motorboat driving, compass and wind directions. Create new routes for competitions. Watch the skippers compete and guess who will be the winner, or drive and sail yourself.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This game is intended for young children and their boating parents!<br> <br>- Very easy and casual playing or just watching -<br><br>Lullapops Sail Race</i></strong><i> is an exciting sailing and motorboat racing 3D physics game where you compete against autopilot controlled boats  in dynamic waters. Choose your skipper or  steer your boat  through red-green gates to victory! Experience realistic wind mechanics, master sailing strategies like tacking, or speed through the course in motorboat mode. Create custom race routes, adjust weather conditions, and challenge yourself to become the ultimate champion.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Learn the basics of sailing and motorboat driving, compass and wind directions. Create new routes 